<p>Hum Hai Hussain Waale, Hum Hai Hussain Waale</p>

<p>1. Pyaason ki yaad me hi paani pilaate hai<br />
Karbobala ka waaqeya sabko sunaate hai<br />
Hum hai hussain waale tumhein ye bataate hai<br />
Seenon ko hum lahu ka samandar banaate hai</p>

<p>2. Farwa ka tha bayaan mera qasim nahi raha<br />
Laila ye roke kehti thi akbar nahi raha<br />
Bano ki god me ali asghar nahi raha<br />
Aabaad ghar ujadh gaya, koi nahi raha</p>

<p>3. Pusht e nabi pe dekhiye jaan e namaz hai<br />
Ishq e ali ke waste qayam namaz hai<br />
Waise hi tum ada karo jaisi namaz hai<br />
Aage hussain hai mera peeche namaz hai</p>

<p>4. Deen e nabi ke waste sarwar ne sar diye<br />
Zainab ne dono laal ko qurbaan kardiye<br />
Abbas ne furaat pe do baazu de diye<br />
Waada tha ek sar ka bahattar ne sar diye</p>

<p>5. Zahra ki hai tamanna karo gham hussain ka<br />
Majlis hussain ki hai ye maatam hussain ka<br />
Mehshar me kaam aayega maatam hussain ka<br />
Ye Murtuza sunaatha hai nouha hussain ka</p>

<p>Hum hai hussain waale, Hum hai hussain waale</p>


